      "rationale": "This is the empty-sequence base equation defining the allInts predicate; it names the mathematical input-domain test and does not execute or observe a program configuration.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-8277b118773512287e2b2b20da4dbf45607f85956623bafa9028b50596471d08",
      "start_line": 8,
      "text": "  rule allInts(.ValSeq)                => true"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [],
      "classification": "DEFINITION",
      "end_line": 9,
      "module": "VERIFICATION",
      "normalized_sha256": "bb65aed9f318cb650e6f3aaeb61b929864859d3dc05404f2b4a53b0d1f2058d0",
      "rationale": "This is the structurally recursive nonempty-sequence equation defining allInts from the head's integer sort test and the predicate on the tail.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-bb65aed9f318cb650e6f3aaeb61b929864859d3dc05404f2b4a53b0d1f2058d0",
      "start_line": 9,
      "text": "  rule allInts(vCons(V:Val, R:ValSeq)) => isInt(V) andBool allInts(R)"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [],
      "classification": "DEFINITION",
      "end_line": 14,
      "module": "VERIFICATION",
      "normalized_sha256": "6c55d502b263cd9488fb4d13c18990fa8865f154bf5db922ef461ae84c961308",
      "rationale": "This is the empty-REST base equation defining rdAcc to return the accumulated output sequence unchanged.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-6c55d502b263cd9488fb4d13c18990fa8865f154bf5db922ef461ae84c961308",
      "start_line": 14,
      "text": "  rule rdAcc(ACC:ValSeq, .ValSeq, _ALL:ValSeq) => ACC"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [],
      "classification": "DEFINITION",
      "end_line": 19,
      "module": "VERIFICATION",
      "normalized_sha256": "7614bf9bc54b61933d1cbd1d534bb404043cb2a80c42f36e07b6cf7486cf642d",
      "rationale": "This is the structurally recursive nonempty-REST equation defining rdAcc by conditionally appending the head exactly when its supplied occurrence count is one, then recurring on the tail.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-7614bf9bc54b61933d1cbd1d534bb404043cb2a80c42f36e07b6cf7486cf642d",
      "start_line": 15,
      "text": "  rule rdAcc(ACC:ValSeq, vCons(V:Val, R:ValSeq), ALL:ValSeq)\n    => #if 1 ==Int cntOccVS(ALL, V)\n       #then rdAcc(valSeqConcat(ACC, vCons(V, .ValSeq)), R, ALL)\n       #else rdAcc(ACC, R, ALL)\n       #fi"
    }
  ],
